-- Hand-written (drizzle-kit cannot state a privilege): chat_case_events is APPEND-ONLY for every lane (D-810, T-12.4-03).
-- It has no write policy, and the default privileges of `public` would still hand `authenticated` UPDATE, DELETE and
-- TRUNCATE (TRUNCATE ignores RLS), so they are revoked; the definers and triggers that write it run as the owner.
-- INSERT stays granted but has no policy, so a lane insert is refused by RLS. The system lane keeps its privileges.
